mplemented in 4.6 or 4.7), so I'm not sure if we should fix this.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952723962/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952751583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107239#issuecomment-2952751583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107239","id":2952751583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v_2nf","user":{"login":"blkc","id":7827466,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4Mjc0NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7827466?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc","html_url":"https://github.com/blkc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-07T16:57:03Z","updated_at":"2025-06-07T16:57:03Z","body":"So IK targets would show in the scene tree if they exist? That is great to know. I guess I will wait for the new IK then. Thanks alot 🙇 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952751583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952785889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107239#issuecomment-2952785889","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107239","id":2952785889,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v_-_h","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-07T17:29:43Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T16:46:51Z","body":"> So IK targets would show in the scene tree if they exist?\n\nNo, what I mean is that the current code should work if you replace it with the following.\n\n**ik_controller.gd**\n```\nself.target = new_tip.transform\n```\nto\n```\nself.target_node = new_tip.get_path()\n```\n\nor maybe you can use `self.target = new_tip.global_transform` with `set_notify_transform(true)` and adding signal to your custom `Skeleton3D::_notification()` instead of above.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952785889/reactions